    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f534286764957079a45299</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 16 Mar 2024 05:54:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>曾经 我茫然前行</span><br><span>黯夜的 路上</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><br><span>微风 刺痛著灵魂</span><br><span>找不到应该的方向</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><br><span>生命这样的旅程</span><br><span>要用多少泪水来完整</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>生命这样的旅程</span><br><span>我渴求你的微笑来完整</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>...</span></p><span></span><p><span>”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> Disclaimer: </span><strong><span>讨论歌词绝不代表认可邪教！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>曾经 我茫然前行黯夜的 路上</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>是不是在茫然的时候一定要找到生命的意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>微风 刺痛著灵魂 找不到应该的方向</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>我们（主播）如何尝试寻找方向的（</span><strong><span>个人隐私分享</span></strong><span>）?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a></span></p><span></span><p><em><span>生命这样的旅程 要用多少泪水来完整</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>一个完整的生命旅程，一定要经历痛苦吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2549">42:29</a></span></p><span></span><p><em><span>生命这样的旅程 我渴求你的微笑来完整</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>人生的终极目标一定是追寻快乐吗？</span></p>]]></description>
