    <title>EP.5 | 再开始，来得及吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e59c5f9bf20df4c8ac729d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e59c5f9bf20df4c8ac729d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Mar 2024 10:03:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“</span></p><span></span><p><span>忘掉你曾拥有的。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>万物皆有裂痕，</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>那是光进来的地方。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Forget your perfect offering.</span></p><span></span><p><span>There is a crack in everything.</span></p><span></span><p><span>That's how the light gets in.</span></p><span></span><p><span>”</span></p><span></span><p><span>--《</span><em><span>颂歌》，莱昂纳德·科恩</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>EP.5 | 再开始，来得及吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1. 什么是定义太晚了就来不及的关键？ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 改变生活习惯，重拾健康生活,还来得及吗? <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="871">14:31</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 战胜对尝试新事物的恐惧,还来得及吗? <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">20:18</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 摆脱"太晚了"的消极思维,还来得及吗? <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>5. 走出情感创伤,重建自信,还来得及吗? <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2192">36:32</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>6. 进入社会，再交到知心朋友，还来得及吗？ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2926">48:46</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>7. 与原生家庭和解,还来得及吗? <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3375">56:15</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>8. 重新审视人生价值观,寻找新方向,还来得及吗? <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3719">1:01:59</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>9. 唤醒内心觉知,开启灵性成长,还来得及吗? <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4087">1:08:07</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>10. 放下“过去”，来得及吗？ 【现在上车NVD 和BTC 还来得及吗？】<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4339">1:12:19</a></span></p>]]></description>
