  <item>
    <title>EP.4 | 就用这一年，回归真实自我</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d624e83af97665af2479bd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d624e83af97665af2479bd</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 Feb 2024 16:29:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>EP.4 | 用一年的时间回归，真实自我</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>"</span></strong><span>是的，我曾翻山越岭，</span><br><span>在遥远的地方行走。</span><br><span>若非站在高处和远方</span><br><span>我又如何能看见你们？</span><br><span>一个人若不是离得远，</span><br><span>他又怎能真正地靠近？"</span></p><span></span><p><span>--纪伯伦, The Farewell</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> &nbsp;你觉得什么是“真实自我”</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>如何发现“真实自我”</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>2.1 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 读书能不能发现？</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.2 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1041">17:21</a> 苦难能不能发现?</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.3 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1539">25:39</a> 旅游能不能发现?</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.4 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1946">32:26</a> 工作能不能发现?</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.5 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2127">35:27</a> 社交能不能发现?</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.6 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2486">41:26</a> 信仰能不能发现？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>如何活出“真实自我”</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>3.1 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2744">45:44</a> 接纳自我“阴暗面”算吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.2 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3163">52:43</a> 不说谎话算吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.3 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3503">58:23</a> 想哭就哭，想笑就笑，算吗?</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>也请你告诉我你的想法，也祝你新的一年，找到自己。</span></strong></p>]]></description>
